[ti:O Little Town of Bethlehem]
[ar:Phillips Brooks (1868), music Lewis H. Redner (1868)]
[length:01:10]
[by:SingLearn - Nhom 10 (auto-aligned, faster-whisper)]
[00:00.30]O little town of Bethlehem,
[00:06.60]How still we see thee lie!
[00:14.18]Above thy deep and dreamless sleep
[00:20.60]The silent stars go by;
[00:28.76]Yet in thy dark streets shineth
[00:35.90]The everlasting Light;
[00:44.44]The hopes and fears of all the years
[00:54.74]Are met in thee tonight.
[01:03.12]
